ending_call_516f1c3c	e	I'm here.	game/endings.rpy	127	e "[what]"
ending_call_ca2ceaf0		The apartment folds inward.	game/endings.rpy	128	"[what]"
ending_call_cefbbed4		The walls become the inside of a mouth. The floor becomes a tongue.	game/endings.rpy	129	"[what]"
ending_call_e1627d6a		The phone cord goes down and down and down.	game/endings.rpy	130	"[what]"
ending_call_09a44c9e		Maya screams your name.	game/endings.rpy	133	"[what]"
ending_call_2d9dcbd4		You hear it from a long way off, the way you used to hear Iris through the wall.	game/endings.rpy	134	"[what]"
ending_call_6e4c5dd7		You do not turn around.	game/endings.rpy	135	"[what]"
ending_call_26efe986		There is no one left to scream.	game/endings.rpy	137	"[what]"
ending_call_d1cb8b10		The dial tone becomes a lullaby.	game/endings.rpy	139	"[what]"
ending_call_e3d3aa92		The lullaby becomes a voice.	game/endings.rpy	140	"[what]"
ending_call_6bd76108		The voice becomes yours.	game/endings.rpy	141	"[what]"
ending_call_fa175071		One year later, a new tenant signs for 3B.	game/endings.rpy	145	"[what]"
ending_call_95ac1e97		He is twenty years old. He has two suitcases and a key that feels older than he does.	game/endings.rpy	146	"[what]"
ending_call_e736a07a		The apartment is cheap. The agency calls it a bargain.	game/endings.rpy	147	"[what]"
ending_call_6e2b08c3		He does not ask what happened to the last tenant.	game/endings.rpy	148	"[what]"
ending_call_7fec011d		At 2:58 AM, he is awake.	game/endings.rpy	150	"[what]"
ending_call_643d75ff		At 2:59 AM, the rain stops.	game/endings.rpy	151	"[what]"
ending_call_57085888		At 3:00 AM, his phone rings.	game/endings.rpy	152	"[what]"
ending_call_904f2f21		The screen shows no number.	game/endings.rpy	154	"[what]"
ending_call_52b3c57f		He answers anyway.	game/endings.rpy	155	"[what]"
