ending_newgame_f160a710		Then the room turns inside out.	game/endings.rpy	175	"[what]"
ending_newgame_724804e4		You are looking at yourself from the other side of the glass.	game/endings.rpy	176	"[what]"
ending_newgame_baaf8d6e		You see the apartment. The boxes. The key on the windowsill.	game/endings.rpy	177	"[what]"
ending_newgame_cc709164		You see a new tenant standing in the doorway, holding two cups of coffee.	game/endings.rpy	178	"[what]"
ending_newgame_9e581c50		He is younger than you remember being.	game/endings.rpy	179	"[what]"
ending_newgame_338ee124		He is smiling.	game/endings.rpy	180	"[what]"
ending_newgame_030f0475		You try to warn him. Your mouth forms the words. No sound comes out.	game/endings.rpy	181	"[what]"
